        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/bc23121995a935e5d8e5fb173507fa8d.avif?t=1789130429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras_big/bc23121995a935e5d8e5fb173507fa8d.avif?t=1789130429 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/544ce71a8af38bde6764b32e54e150d5.avif?t=1789130429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras_big/544ce71a8af38bde6764b32e54e150d5.avif?t=1789130429 width=1560 height=816 /></span>ourney in <strong>Fengshenyanyi SandBox</strong>, a unique blend of city-building, grand strategy, and real-time mass combat set in the mythological universe of the Chinese <i>Investiture of the Gods</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Divine Dynasty:</strong> Establish and manage your celestial city, harnessing divine powers and mortal resources to fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Legendary Heroes:</strong> Take direct control of the Third Lotus Prince, <strong>Nezha</strong>, a demigod of unparalleled might and agility, leading your armies from the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Unprecedented Scale:</strong> Engage in colossal real-time battles where <strong>thousands of units clash simultaneously</strong> on a single screen. Witness the breathtaking chaos of true mythological warfare, optimized for stunning performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the current Demo, you can experience the core thrill of combat:</strong> <br>Lead Nezha and <strong>an army of 1,000 warriors</strong> into a monumental three-way free-for-all melee. Your foes are not one, but <strong>three distinct and formidable factions</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corrupt Dynasty of Zhaoge:</strong> The decadent human empire you are destined to overthrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Disciplined Roman Legion:</strong> A mysterious force from the West, wielding impeccable shield walls and disciplined tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Feudal Japanese Samurai Horde:</strong> A relentless eastern army, striking with swift katana and unwavering bushido spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot terminator T-800 T800.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction boasts unique units, tactics, and strengths, ensuring every battle is a dynamic and strategic challenge. Will you conquer all?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/bc23121995a935e5d8e5fb173507fa8d.avif?t=1789130429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras_big/bc23121995a935e5d8e5fb173507fa8d.avif?t=1789130429 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/544ce71a8af38bde6764b32e54e150d5.avif?t=1789130429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras_big/544ce71a8af38bde6764b32e54e150d5.avif?t=1789130429 width=1560 height=816 /></span>ourney in <strong>Fengshenyanyi SandBox</strong>, a unique blend of city-building, grand strategy, and real-time mass combat set in the mythological universe of the Chinese <i>Investiture of the Gods</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Divine Dynasty:</strong> Establish and manage your celestial city, harnessing divine powers and mortal resources to fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Legendary Heroes:</strong> Take direct control of the Third Lotus Prince, <strong>Nezha</strong>, a demigod of unparalleled might and agility, leading your armies from the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Unprecedented Scale:</strong> Engage in colossal real-time battles where <strong>thousands of units clash simultaneously</strong> on a single screen. Witness the breathtaking chaos of true mythological warfare, optimized for stunning performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the current Demo, you can experience the core thrill of combat:</strong> <br>Lead Nezha and <strong>an army of 1,000 warriors</strong> into a monumental three-way free-for-all melee. Your foes are not one, but <strong>three distinct and formidable factions</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corrupt Dynasty of Zhaoge:</strong> The decadent human empire you are destined to overthrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Disciplined Roman Legion:</strong> A mysterious force from the West, wielding impeccable shield walls and disciplined tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Feudal Japanese Samurai Horde:</strong> A relentless eastern army, striking with swift katana and unwavering bushido spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot terminator T-800 T800.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction boasts unique units, tactics, and strengths, ensuring every battle is a dynamic and strategic challenge. Will you conquer all?</p>",
